  "description": "Cross-platform code signing from Linux, macOS, or Windows with the private key held in Azure Trusted Signing, where it never leaves the HSM. Author-signs NuGet packages and Authenticode-signs Windows PE binaries. Fills the gap between `dotnet sign`, which supports Trusted Signing but only runs on Windows, and `dotnet nuget sign`, which runs anywhere but requires a local private key.",
  "id": "SignUniversal",
